requirement art 1 par 3 customs provisions has the comment "Cross-reference to existing customs law provisions for the application of the anti-dumping duty.".


action apply duty rate is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/antidumping-microdisks#Action_ApplyDutyRate".

action apply duty rate has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

action apply duty rate is an action.

action apply duty rate has the label "Apply Anti-Dumping Duty Rate".

action apply duty rate has the agent role agent role customs authorities applier.

action apply duty rate has the comment "Action of applying the appropriate duty rate to imports of 3.5\" microdisks.".


agent role customs authorities applier is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/antidumping-microdisks#AgentRole_CustomsAuthorities_Applier".

agent role customs authorities applier has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

agent role customs authorities applier is an agent role.

agent role customs authorities applier is for the agent agent type customs authorities.

agent role customs authorities applier has the role addressee.

agent role customs authorities applier has the comment "Customs authorities act as addressees obligated to apply the duty rates.".


requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/antidumping-microdisks#Requirement_Art2_Par1_DefinitiveCollection".

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the label "Article 2(1) - Definitive Collection of Provisional Duties".

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the modality obligation.

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_d98a69b9".

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection produces action collect provisional duty.

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the condition condition provisional duty exceeds definitive.

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/1993/2861/art_2/par_1/oj".

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the legal text "The amounts secured by way of the provisional anti-dumping duty under Regulation (EEC) No 920/93 in respect of 3,5″ microdisks shall be definitively collected. Where the provisional duty exceeds the duty rate definitively imposed, the amount collected should not exceed that of the definitive duty.".

requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the comment "Transitional provision for definitive collection of amounts secured under the provisional duty, with a cap where provisional exceeded definitive.".


requirement art 2 par 2 release excess is identified by "http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo/antidumping-microdisks#Requirement_Art2_Par2_ReleaseExcess".

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the type "owl:NamedIndividual".

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess is a prescriptive rule.

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the label "Article 2(2) - Release of Excess Amounts".

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the modality obligation.

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_d98a69b9".

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess produces action release excess amounts.

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the condition condition amounts secured in excess.

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/1993/2861/art_2/par_2/oj".

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the legal text "Amounts secured in excess of the definitive rate of duty shall be released.".

requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the comment "Obligation to release any amounts secured that exceed the definitive duty rate.".


