action collect provisional duty is an action.

action collect provisional duty has the label "Definitively Collect Provisional Duty Amounts".

action collect provisional duty has the agent role agent role customs authorities collector.

action collect provisional duty has the comment "Action of definitively collecting the amounts secured under provisional Regulation (EEC) No 920/93.".


