% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    modalities expects answers ["requirement art 1 par 2 a japan has the modality obligation", "requirement art 1 par 2 b taiwan has the modality obligation", "requirement art 1 par 2 c china has the modality obligation", "requirement art 1 par 2 duty rates has the modality obligation", "requirement art 1 par 3 customs provisions has the modality obligation", "requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection has the modality obligation", "requirement art 2 par 2 release excess has the modality obligation"].
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["requirement art 1 par 2 a japan produces action apply duty rate", "requirement art 1 par 2 b taiwan produces action apply duty rate", "requirement art 1 par 2 c china produces action apply duty rate", "requirement art 1 par 2 duty rates produces action apply duty rate", "requirement art 1 par 3 customs provisions produces action apply duty rate", "requirement art 2 par 1 definitive collection produces action collect provisional duty", "requirement art 2 par 2 release excess produces action release excess amounts"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["agent type customs authorities acts as addressee in action apply duty rate", "agent type customs authorities acts as addressee in action collect provisional duty", "agent type customs authorities acts as addressee in action release excess amounts"].

